<title>BARBADOS: CRICKET-RED STRIPE CUP SCORES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-RED STRIPE CUP SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>BRIDGETOWN 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Close of play scores on the third day of four-day Red Stripe Cup cricket matches on Sunday:</p>
<p>In Port-of-Spain: Leeward Islands beat Trinidad and Tobago by 55 runs. Leeward Islands 208 and 95. Trinidad and Tobago 110 (W.Quinn 4-39) and 138 (B.Lara 52; M.Mills 5-33).</p>
<p>In St George's, Grenada: Windward Islands 446 and 75-3. Guyana 315 (N.Mcgarrell 73, Z.Haniff 66, R.Sarwan 54; R.Lewis 4-104).</p>
<p>In Bridgetown: Barbados 258 and 180 (P.Wallace 53; C.Walsh 6-39. Jamaica 282 and 107-2 (R.Sammuels 60 not out).</p>
</text>
